      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate issue, may be merged with: [YouTube videos fail to load frequently!](https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/youtube-videos-fail-to-load-frequently)\n\nVRChat's yt-dlp is still 2026.02.04 on Windows, but the most recent yt-dlp 2026.03.03 release has issues too. Pending on: [Recent players failing on all variants · Issue #51 · yt-dlp/ejs · GitHub](https://github.com/yt-dlp/ejs/issues/51) - I'm tracking this issue at the following feature request topic on Canny: [Update yt-dlp to 2026.02.21 to resolve YouTube playback issues](https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/update-yt-dlp-to-20260221-to-resolve-youtube-playback-issues)\n\n@{69b069cd95d05cb74004c86d|full_name} Generally when submitting a bug report, please include output logs or the error message, as there numerous reasons why YouTube playback may fail - e.g. \"Sign in to confirm you're not a bot\" is not fixable, but missing media formats due to failed n sig deciphering are solvable. (It wouldn't matter too much here, because upstream yt-dlp is having difficulties too.)",
